This .gitkeep keeps its otherwise-empty (or content-ignored) folder tracked in git.

GENERATED — every .gitkeep is reproduced from pwsh/Catzc.Base.Docs/assets/gitkeep on import
(Build-GitKeep); edit that source, never a copy. Everything worth knowing about this folder is in its
README.md, generated from the folder's docs/references article — an integrity test guarantees the article
exists (see docs/adr/repository/generated-readmes.md).
